==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[M. Ost]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The best way to approach this stage is to rush down Golem Sunfish before the first M. Ost comes out, or else it will be too overwhelming. The best way to do this is with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] or [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] with combos.

Afterwards, you can clean up with Slapstick Cats and any relic CC that works on M. Ost, since there are very few peons that come out during the stage.

